## feat(api): add GET /api/v1/digitaltwin/nodes/context endpoint

**Context:** Task 3 of the MCP node-context feature. Adds the REST endpoint that resolves an entity URI to its ontology class and returns linked dataset metadata (with optional row retrieval) and bridge definitions (with optional cross-domain traversal).

**Changes:**
1. `src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py` — Added `NodeContextDataset`, `NodeContextBridge`, `NodeContextResponse` Pydantic models in the response-models section.
2. `src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py` — Added `dt_nodes_context` route handler for `GET /nodes/context`; resolves class by URI prefix, returns dataset metadata and bridges; caps dataset rows at 1–20; skips row fetch when `key_column` missing; swallows per-bridge traversal errors with a warning.
3. `tests/units/api/test_node_context_endpoint.py` — Created unit tests (TDD, 4 cases): `test_metadata_only_by_default`, `test_missing_entity_uri_returns_422`, `test_unknown_class_returns_empty_context`, `test_dataset_rows_skipped_when_key_column_missing`.

**Modified files:**
- `src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py`
- `tests/units/api/test_node_context_endpoint.py` (new)

**Test result:** 4/4 new tests pass; full suite 3316 passed, 275 skipped, 0 failures.

